WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.554
Ko crocodiil mo o hisniri kaanankeejo. Fedde kassena.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.418
Abem laati mannguɗo, mawɗo saare Kassena. O wurti, bana no o waɗata nder nyalawma fuu, bee kaŋŋe maako.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.458
Ammaa leɗɗe ɗon halki ngam de'i mawɗi. Yiite ɗon ɓeyda.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.970
Abem ɗon tokki antelop, ɓeydaaki. Ammaa nde o ummii, walaa ko o anndi.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.072
Nde naange wurtini, njaram maɓɓiti mo.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.970
O wurtini ko'e maako. O walaa goɗɗum.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.552
O tokki ɓeya, o waroyi.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.426
Walaa ko ɗon hoosi nder leɗɗe. Ɗu'um woni kooɗume nder ndiyam.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.170
Abem yi'i yahugo maako, ammaa juŋŋgo maako tokki mo. O maaki gite maako.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.426
Krokodil naa nyaamataa. O jippini mo bee ɓernde laaɓɗum.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:32.108
Abem ummi. Go'oto ɓadake, o wayliti, o wi'i: "Taa yam".

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.752
Hakkiilo leɗɗe ɗon woodi ndiyam ɓoyma.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.272
Abem maɓɓiti, nden ndu ummi.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.896
Sey o yaari haa ko'e maako, o sujidani ɗum.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.690
En mburtataa ko'e mum. Walaa mi, wala ɓiɓɓe am.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.456
O wi'i yimɓe maako ɓe njokki alkawal ngal.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.632
O ɗon nyaama en naa?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.896
Haa hande, koo toɓɓe saare kassena'en ɗon ɗaɓɓa ko crocodile woni totem.
